  "title": "Israeli settlers escalate attacks on Palestinian communities in the West Bank, with casualties",
  "summary": "Israeli settlers set fire to Palestinian homes and vehicles in villages near Nablus, while Palestinians claim the attacks are part of ongoing tensions between settlers and Palestinian communities. Four Palestinians and one Israeli settler were killed in a shooting in the northern West Bank, according to health officials. A senior officer in the Hamas-run police force was among those killed in the strike, which Israel's military says targeted 'terrorists.'",
